{
  "slug": "outputai",
  "name": "Outputai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Output.ai workflow development toolkit for Claude Code. Adds 5 specialist agents (planner, builder, debugger, prompt writer, quality reviewer), 40+ slash-command skills covering scaffolding, debugging, evaluation, and credential management, plus a SessionStart hook that auto-loads Output SDK conventions so Claude understands the framework before the first prompt.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **50 skills**, **5 agents** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (50): `output-build-workflow` (Implement an Output SDK workflow from a plan document), `output-credentials-edit` (View and edit encrypted credentials in an Output.ai project), `output-credentials-env-vars` (Wire encrypted credentials to environment variables using the credential: convention), `output-credentials-init` (Initialize encrypted credentials for an Output.ai project), `output-debug-workflow` (Debug Output SDK workflow issues), `output-dev-agent-class` (Use the Agent class for multi-step tool loops, conversation history, streaming progress, and reusable LLM agents), `output-dev-code-style` (Code style conventions for Output SDK workflow projects), `output-dev-create-skeleton` (Generate workflow skeleton files using the Output SDK CLI), and 42 more\n- **Agents** (5): `workflow_context_fetcher` (Use proactively to retrieve and extract relevant information from Output SDK project documentation files), `workflow_debugger` (Use this agent when you need to debug Output SDK workflows in local development), `workflow_planner` (Design new workflows for the Output SDK system, plan complex workflow orchestrations, or create comprehensive implementation blueprints), `workflow_prompt_writer` (Use this agent when writing, reviewing, or debugging LLM prompt files (.prompt)), `workflow_quality` (Use this agent when you need expert guidance on Output SDK implementation patterns, code quality, and best practices)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install outputai@claude-plugins-official` from `growthxai/output` (`coding_assistants/claude/plugins/outputai`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 50,
    "agent": 5,
    "hook": 1
  },
